      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><strong>Robert Yang</strong> (<a href="https://x.com/GuangyuRobert">@GuangyuRobert</a>)</p><blockquote><p>Peter breaks down the craft of performance-agent building. The hard part is to really polish the tokens that always go into the agent's context<br/><br/>Love the cache analogy</p></blockquote><div><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HKn9fuCb0AAW3_F.png" alt="" style="max-width:480px;margin:4px"/></div><p style="color:#777;font-size:0.9em">♥ 9 · 🔁 1 · 🔖 12</p><p><a href="https://x.com/GuangyuRobert/status/2065242047767019725">View on X →</a></p>]]></content:encoded>
