      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><strong>YanXbt</strong> (<a href="https://x.com/IBuzovskyi">@IBuzovskyi</a>)</p><blockquote><p>HERMES AGENT JUST SHIPPED A PROFILE BUILDER<br/>IN THE DASHBOARD.<br/><br/>build a complete agent in one guided flow.<br/>no CLI. no config editing. no guesswork. @NousResearch <br/><br/>open Profiles from the sidebar.<br/>click Build (next to quick Create).<br/>follow the 5-step wizard:<br/><br/>Identity → Model → Skills → MCPs → Review<br/><br/>IDENTITY<br/>→ name, description, SOUL.md<br/>→ this becomes slot #1 in the system prompt<br/><br/>MODEL<br/>→ pick provider and model for this agent<br/>→ same 150+ config fields available in the dashboard<br/><br/>SKILLS<br/>→ toggle built-in and optional skills<br/>→ search the Skills Hub across all sources<br/>→ install with live progress log<br/>→ update all installed skills in one click<br/><br/>MCPs<br/>→ add HTTP/SSE servers by URL<br/>→ add stdio servers by command + args + env vars<br/>→ browse the Nous-approved MCP catalog<br/>→ one-click install from catalog<br/>→ test any server before committing<br/>  (connect → list tools → verify → disconnect)<br/><br/>REVIEW<br/>→ full summary of the new agent<br/>→ confirm and deploy<br/><br/>one wizard replaces: hermes profile create,<br/>manual SOUL.md edit, config.yaml changes,<br/>skills install one by one, MCP setup via CLI.<br/><br/>hermes dashboard → Profiles → Build<br/><br/>8 loops inside Hermes Agent 👇</p></blockquote><div><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2064763286550122496/img/i4r6DalBr40DOnr2.jpg" alt="" style="max-width:480px;margin:4px"/></div><p style="color:#777;font-size:0.9em">♥ 110 · 🔁 16 · 💬 10 · 🔖 145</p><p><a href="https://x.com/IBuzovskyi/status/2064763405953855834">View on X →</a></p>]]></content:encoded>
