      <dc:creator>Trevin Chow</dc:creator>
      <description>Reminder: most suggestions you’ll read about “killer prompts to use with Fable” are not good for Fable.
&gt;
&gt; Anthropic published a guide for how different prompting is with their new token torching model:
&gt;
&gt; https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/prompt-engineering/prompting-claude-fable-5

Tweet: https://x.com/trevin/status/2064727024288317658
Primary URLs:
