      <title>@linear: Last week we launched Diffs, a new way to review PRs directly inside Linear. The most...</title>
      <link>https://x.com/linear/status/2064391292302307556</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">2064391292302307556</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 09 Jun 2026 16:56:53 GMT</pubDate>
      <dc:creator>Linear</dc:creator>
