      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><strong>AlphaSignal AI</strong> (<a href="https://x.com/AlphaSignalAI">@AlphaSignalAI</a>)</p><blockquote><p>Agent loops are not a default, even if it's viral..<br/><br/>They only work when the task repeats, the agent can run the code, and something inside the loop can reject bad output.<br/><br/>Miss that gate and you are just automating token burn. <a href="https://t.co/Iuyrc08KxA">https://t.co/Iuyrc08KxA</a></p></blockquote><div><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HKUo8sAX0AEB8Ib.jpg" alt="" style="max-width:480px;margin:4px"/></div><hr/><p>🔗 <a href="https://alphasignal.ai/newsletter">https://alphasignal.ai/newsletter</a></p><p style="color:#777;font-size:0.9em">♥ 97 · 🔁 13 · 💬 16 · 🔖 110</p><p><a href="https://x.com/AlphaSignalAI/status/2064101792103678340">View on X →</a></p>]]></content:encoded>
